WEBVTT

00:10.520 --> 00:12.270
What lovely weather.

00:12.270 --> 00:14.840
The laundry should dry quickly today.

00:19.590 --> 00:21.150
Freeze solid!

00:29.770 --> 00:32.600
What an embarrassing memory.

00:39.520 --> 00:41.620
Bigger harvest than I expected.

00:42.550 --> 00:45.590
Sister, I'm done cleaning my room!

00:45.590 --> 00:47.340
Thanks, Rosalie.

00:47.750 --> 00:51.200
Isn't this a mild itch mushroom?

00:51.510 --> 00:53.040
Yes, it is!

00:53.040 --> 00:56.150
Eating them makes you feel tickly all over.

00:56.150 --> 00:58.580
That's one crazy mushroom.

00:58.930 --> 01:02.000
They're very rare, Master!

01:02.000 --> 01:05.070
Don't you dare put those in our dinner!

01:09.210 --> 01:10.810
What's this?

01:10.810 --> 01:14.630
Where could Falfa and Shalsha have gone?

01:14.630 --> 01:16.220
Mama!

01:14.630 --> 01:16.220
Boo!

01:16.580 --> 01:19.250
Hey now, you two!

01:19.810 --> 01:21.850
We surprised you.

01:21.850 --> 01:23.830
Mischievous little things!

01:25.110 --> 01:26.370
Were you surprised?

01:26.370 --> 01:28.300
I sure was!

01:29.050 --> 01:30.710
Hello!

01:32.340 --> 01:33.980
Coming!

01:43.580 --> 01:54.550
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

03:06.750 --> 03:09.750
<b>Laika Entered a Martial Arts Tournament</b>

03:13.670 --> 03:15.730
They're both going hard.

03:15.730 --> 03:18.970
Fairly so. But not hard enough.

03:19.460 --> 03:22.720
The great Flatorte would use 
her tail in that scenario.

03:22.720 --> 03:24.890
Animals are so barbaric.

03:24.890 --> 03:26.800
Plants are peaceful.

03:26.800 --> 03:30.720
We never hit each other 
or swing swords around.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.970
I don't think I'd want 
to see a plant do that.

03:33.970 --> 03:36.730
So what are those two doing, anyway?

03:36.730 --> 03:40.940
Fightie says she's entering a martial 
arts tournament in Heynt Province.

03:40.940 --> 03:43.740
She wanted Laika to spar 
with her as practice.

03:45.740 --> 03:48.860
I don't dislike your kind of diligence!

03:48.860 --> 03:52.630
Yes! I'm going to win and take 
home that 30 million gold!

03:52.870 --> 03:55.120
Of course it's all about money.

03:57.730 --> 04:01.340
All right, Laika, I'm going 
to come at you for real now!

04:01.340 --> 04:05.420
Fightie Style Slime Fist Secret Technique...

04:12.300 --> 04:13.810
Low Heavy Kick!

04:14.190 --> 04:15.720
Is this a fighting game?!

04:17.050 --> 04:18.770
Low Heavy Kick!

04:19.220 --> 04:21.270
That's one boring secret technique.

04:21.270 --> 04:22.890
Low Heavy Kick!

04:23.140 --> 04:24.530
Low Heavy Kick!

04:24.650 --> 04:26.270
Low Heavy Kick!

04:26.270 --> 04:28.280
And it's cheese, too.

04:29.260 --> 04:30.700
I will now counter!

04:31.180 --> 04:32.610
Fire Breath!

04:34.900 --> 04:36.540
Fire scares me!

04:36.800 --> 04:40.270
A-Are you all right?! I did hold back...

04:40.270 --> 04:42.290
Should I chill you with my ice breath?

04:42.290 --> 04:46.200
No, I can clear up this 
little blaze by doing this!

04:46.200 --> 04:48.060
Roll, roll. Roll, roll.

04:48.060 --> 04:52.040
But, Fightie, there's a hill 
just past you, so be care—

04:50.690 --> 04:53.430
Roll, roll, roll, roll...

04:54.690 --> 04:55.440
<b>Crack</b>

04:58.600 --> 04:59.980
Fightie!

04:59.980 --> 05:01.060
Are you okay?

05:04.880 --> 05:06.650
Fightie?!

05:09.030 --> 05:12.190
It seems I've injured my back.

05:12.190 --> 05:14.820
I just can't get back to my original form.

05:15.230 --> 05:18.700
So just the slightest bounce 
turns you back into a slime?

05:19.060 --> 05:22.090
My sister also reverted to a slime 
when she got a kink in her neck.

05:22.090 --> 05:24.820
But I couldn't talk as a slime.

05:24.820 --> 05:28.720
That's a good point. 
Fightie, you can talk, huh?

05:28.720 --> 05:31.360
Yeah, I wonder why!

05:31.360 --> 05:33.110
Because of my training, I guess!

05:33.110 --> 05:34.850
That seems arbitrary.

05:35.110 --> 05:36.840
But what will you do now?

05:36.840 --> 05:39.480
Isn't the martial arts 
tournament in five days?

05:39.480 --> 05:43.360
I'm so sorry. If it hadn't 
been for my flames...

05:43.360 --> 05:46.140
No, I'm the one who got careless.

05:46.140 --> 05:48.360
Injuries are just part of sparring.

05:48.360 --> 05:52.110
It's fine! I'll enter the 
tournament just like this!

05:52.110 --> 05:54.130
What?!

05:54.130 --> 05:57.620
There's no rule saying a slime 
can't enter, after all!

05:57.620 --> 05:59.330
You can't, though!

05:59.330 --> 06:02.590
The sheer novelty of it will 
draw unwanted attention to you.

06:03.460 --> 06:05.960
You'll be vanquished in no time.

06:05.960 --> 06:08.620
Yes, you're right...

06:09.040 --> 06:12.840
But still, that 30 million gold...

06:12.840 --> 06:17.470
I sure wish it was 300 million... 
no, three trillion!

06:17.470 --> 06:20.480
<i>That number's going up exponentially...</i>

06:20.480 --> 06:23.850
Very well! I shall lend you a hand!

06:24.120 --> 06:28.680
I will enter the tournament along with 
Fightie as "Laika the Slime-Mancer"!

06:28.680 --> 06:30.510
What?!

06:40.870 --> 06:44.850
I can't believe she was really 
able to enter as a slime-mancer.

06:44.850 --> 06:47.890
Laika says she's only going to 
keep an eye on Fightie, but...

06:47.890 --> 06:51.480
Yes, but how is Fightie going to fight?

06:51.480 --> 06:54.510
She can't even kick or punch in that form.

06:56.500 --> 07:01.390
And now, the third match in the 
preliminary round will begin!

07:06.400 --> 07:08.030
Oh, come on!

07:08.030 --> 07:11.900
I'm up against a little girl 
and a slime? Are you nuts?

07:12.380 --> 07:16.730
I always break a bone or two of 
any opponent I'm up against,

07:16.730 --> 07:19.630
but slimes don't have bones, 
so that's gonna be a problem.

07:20.150 --> 07:23.540
I let my guard down and lost 
in that last tournament,

07:23.540 --> 07:25.920
but I'm gonna go all-out this time!

07:25.920 --> 07:29.430
Huh? I've seen him somewhere before...

07:30.550 --> 07:34.190
Now, Laika the Slime-Mancer versus Gandada!

07:34.190 --> 07:35.180
Begin!

07:35.180 --> 07:36.250
Go!

07:36.700 --> 07:38.260
What?! It stretched out?!

07:41.740 --> 07:44.070
It's that attack she used before!

07:44.070 --> 07:45.740
Yep, still cheese.

07:48.740 --> 07:52.310
The winner: Laika the Slime-Mancer!

07:56.060 --> 07:58.250
Cheers!

07:58.590 --> 08:02.250
Congrats on getting past the 
preliminaries, Fightie!

08:02.250 --> 08:06.500
I'm surprised you can move 
like that as a slime.

08:09.010 --> 08:12.620
"I was able to perform a suitably 
slime-like attack today."

08:12.620 --> 08:15.220
"I'd like to keep this up tomorrow, too."

08:15.220 --> 08:16.510
So she says.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.510
Huh?

08:17.890 --> 08:20.020
<i>Why isn't she talking?</i>

08:20.320 --> 08:23.530
Aren't you going to eat anything, Fightie?

08:28.760 --> 08:32.800
"I absorbed nutrients from the dust 
and sand, so I don't need food."

08:32.800 --> 08:36.690
"I'll go to bed early tonight so 
I'll be in top condition tomorrow."

08:36.690 --> 08:38.030
So she says.

08:39.100 --> 08:41.930
I'd like to work on my 
mental focus, as well.

08:41.930 --> 08:43.860
I'll be turning in for the night.

08:44.280 --> 08:46.060
Goodnight, Lady Azusa.

08:49.150 --> 08:52.560
The way those two are focusing 
on this tournament,

08:52.560 --> 08:55.910
they look like a real 
slime-mancer and her slime.

08:56.750 --> 08:58.210
Don't they, Flatorte?

09:02.210 --> 09:03.420
What is it?

09:03.420 --> 09:04.700
Huh?

09:04.700 --> 09:08.280
N-Nothing at all, Master.

09:10.730 --> 09:13.260
It's time for the final 
round in our tournament!

09:13.260 --> 09:15.950
First up is the slime-mancer Laika!

09:16.190 --> 09:19.260
So they managed to make 
it to the final round.

09:19.260 --> 09:21.460
By cheesing every fight, but yeah.

09:29.890 --> 09:31.270
They'll be facing...

09:32.140 --> 09:35.080
the armored knight, Domremy!

09:38.320 --> 09:42.400
That cowardly trick you've 
been using won't work on me!

09:42.400 --> 09:47.850
This armor is not so light that 
a slime can keep me in the air!

09:48.160 --> 09:50.520
Wait, isn't wearing armor unfair?

09:50.520 --> 09:54.370
There's no rule saying a competitor 
can't fight in armor.

09:54.850 --> 09:57.700
Well, Laika's using a loophole, too.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.370
I guess it's all the same.

09:59.760 --> 10:02.230
What shall we do, Fightie?

10:02.230 --> 10:04.960
It'll be fine! All we need to do is attack!

10:06.480 --> 10:09.380
The final round will now begin!

10:09.380 --> 10:10.590
Go!

10:12.120 --> 10:15.260
I'll slice your slime in two!

10:16.140 --> 10:17.770
You little pest!

10:21.270 --> 10:22.660
That won't work!

10:26.770 --> 10:30.180
Oh, dear! Domremy hasn't 
budged in the slightest!

10:30.480 --> 10:33.690
Is there nothing more Laika can do?!

10:33.690 --> 10:35.590
This is not good.

10:35.590 --> 10:37.690
What're you gonna do, Laika?

10:38.080 --> 10:40.450
What's the matter? Come at me!

10:40.760 --> 10:41.690
I shall!

10:41.690 --> 10:44.770
Ultimate slime-mancer technique!

10:47.610 --> 10:49.610
You think the same trick will work?!

10:59.100 --> 11:02.050
Fightie's doing something to him, isn't she?

11:08.050 --> 11:10.100
Laika wins!

11:10.570 --> 11:14.810
The winner: Laika the Slime-Mancer!

11:18.260 --> 11:24.570
I'll bet Fightie stuck to Domremy's 
face so he couldn't breathe.

11:29.440 --> 11:31.940
So much for "martial arts."

11:32.460 --> 11:35.960
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

11:38.150 --> 11:39.780
Thanks a bunch!

11:39.780 --> 11:42.970
The 30 million gold is mine!

11:43.490 --> 11:48.340
Now I can fulfill my greatest 
dream as a martial artist!

11:48.340 --> 11:50.480
You're a walking bundle of materialism.

11:50.760 --> 11:52.840
Well, anyway, congratulations.

11:52.840 --> 11:55.240
That match had me on the edge of my seat!

11:55.540 --> 11:57.850
I learned from it, as well.

11:57.850 --> 12:01.230
I was genuinely impressed 
by your strategy, Fightie.

12:01.230 --> 12:03.540
Nah, that should be my line!

12:03.540 --> 12:08.070
It's thanks to you that I was able to show 
off the fruits of my daily training!

12:08.070 --> 12:13.490
Of course, I have me to thank for dedicating 
myself to the martial arts, too.

12:13.830 --> 12:17.000
<i>You didn't care about 
anything but the money.</i>

12:17.000 --> 12:19.710
Your daily training?

12:20.540 --> 12:23.510
Well, I'm going to set off 
on a journey to train!

12:23.810 --> 12:27.810
Call me if you hear of any more 
tournaments offering prize money!

12:28.540 --> 12:30.510
Take care!

12:30.510 --> 12:32.370
Honestly...

12:32.370 --> 12:35.090
Well, shall we get going... too...

12:40.840 --> 12:44.710
Flatorte, you've been looking that way 
since yesterday. What's out there?

12:44.710 --> 12:46.540
Is there something in those mountains?

12:48.200 --> 12:50.720
W-Well, you see...

12:56.450 --> 13:01.800
I didn't know your homeland was so close 
to the martial arts tournament venue!

13:02.240 --> 13:06.300
I haven't been back since 
you touched my horns.

13:06.300 --> 13:08.760
You should've told me.

13:08.760 --> 13:13.810
Well... frankly, I'm not sure 
I actually <i>want</i> to go there...

13:14.250 --> 13:15.570
Why's that?

13:15.870 --> 13:19.750
To Blue Dragons, power is everything.

13:19.750 --> 13:27.580
So everyone in my homeland might regard me 
as a disgrace since I submitted to you.

13:27.580 --> 13:31.070
Well, that definitely hits home.

13:31.070 --> 13:34.440
Oh, but I'm enjoying my life now,

13:34.440 --> 13:37.080
so it's nothing you need to feel bad about.

13:37.870 --> 13:39.450
Also...

13:39.690 --> 13:41.960
Why is Laika coming with us?!

13:42.360 --> 13:44.330
What's the problem with that?

13:44.690 --> 13:48.720
Isn't the Blue Dragons' mountain 
enemy territory for you?

13:48.720 --> 13:50.240
Well...

13:50.240 --> 13:53.260
But... I mean...

13:53.260 --> 13:57.430
It isn't fair that only 
Flatorte gets to be with you.

13:57.800 --> 13:59.650
<i>Aw, she's so cute!</i>

14:07.860 --> 14:10.440
I-I-I-It's a little...

14:10.440 --> 14:12.310
...c-c-cold.

14:13.080 --> 14:16.380
Well, of course it's cold. 
There's snow up here!

14:16.620 --> 14:20.370
Now, Master, let's head for my house!

14:20.720 --> 14:24.250
How is she so comfortable when 
she's dressed so lightly?

14:24.250 --> 14:28.820
I'm starting to see why she always 
wants to take her clothes off...

14:30.810 --> 14:33.400
Flatorte! You've come home?

14:33.820 --> 14:36.700
We were so worried!
You didn't even contact us!

14:36.700 --> 14:39.040
We heard someone touched your horns.

14:39.040 --> 14:40.900
Y-Yes...

14:41.380 --> 14:43.440
I have come home, but...

14:43.440 --> 14:45.860
At any rate, we're glad you're well.

14:43.750 --> 14:46.370
They actually seem like a normal family.

14:46.370 --> 14:50.650
Well, I doubt there's a parent out there who 
wouldn't be happy to have their kid home.

14:50.650 --> 14:53.430
Hey, don't worry about what happened before.

14:53.800 --> 14:55.900
You may have lost to a Red Dragon,

14:55.900 --> 14:58.410
but it's never wrong to 
take on new challenges.

14:58.410 --> 15:00.670
It's normal to hit someone who angers you.

15:00.670 --> 15:03.940
That's right! You don't 
need to regret a thing!

15:03.940 --> 15:07.050
The coward who wouldn't even 
strike you is the disgrace!

15:07.290 --> 15:09.320
They're not normal at all!

15:09.320 --> 15:11.560
It makes sense for parents like 
them to have a kid like her!

15:11.960 --> 15:14.270
Let me introduce you to these two.

15:14.270 --> 15:18.070
This is my master, Lady Azusa!

15:21.600 --> 15:24.580
Ah, so you're the Witch of the Highlands!

15:24.580 --> 15:28.140
I heard you were strong! 
Let's find out who's stronger later!

15:28.140 --> 15:30.200
You look slimmer than I expected!

15:30.200 --> 15:32.580
Let's find out who's stronger later!

15:32.580 --> 15:35.460
<i>Why do I have to do that with 
people I've only just met?</i>

15:35.800 --> 15:38.580
And this is Laika the Red Dragon.

15:39.060 --> 15:40.680
Pleased to meet you.

15:42.780 --> 15:44.300
What?

15:44.870 --> 15:47.200
Laika... the Red Dragon?

15:48.380 --> 15:52.330
Ah, I see! Sorry our daughter 
took a swing at you!

15:52.330 --> 15:56.340
Water under the bridge! 
Let's find out who's stronger later!

15:56.340 --> 15:58.930
I heard you had great physical strength!

15:58.930 --> 16:02.980
Instead of a fight, let's officially 
find out who's stronger later!

16:02.980 --> 16:04.130
Uh-huh...

16:04.980 --> 16:08.080
<i>They're about as frank as frank gets...</i>

16:09.320 --> 16:12.490
Hey, Flatorte! You're back!

16:12.870 --> 16:17.370
So you're Flatorte's master, huh? 
Let's find out who's stronger!

16:17.670 --> 16:20.180
How powerful is the Witch of the Highlands?

16:20.180 --> 16:21.850
Let's find out who's stronger!

16:21.850 --> 16:24.130
Big Sis! Let's see who's stronger!

16:24.130 --> 16:27.920
<i>They really do value strength 
over all else, huh?</i>

16:27.920 --> 16:32.070
Master, it looks like they all 
want to see your strength.

16:32.070 --> 16:34.850
Would you mind testing your 
strength against a few of them?

16:34.850 --> 16:37.520
What? I really don't want to do that.

16:37.520 --> 16:39.640
I don't want bragging rights or anything.

16:39.640 --> 16:43.230
But if you don't beat someone to a pulp now,

16:43.230 --> 16:48.650
they might come to our house in the highlands 
to test your strength out of boredom.

16:49.210 --> 16:50.710
I'll give it all I've got.

16:58.500 --> 17:00.460
Is that good enough?

17:02.740 --> 17:04.460
Who's next?

17:04.820 --> 17:06.040
Me!

17:06.040 --> 17:09.950
I want to fight the witch while 
she's fresh, before she gets tired!

17:10.550 --> 17:12.240
"Fresh"? Excuse me?

17:13.860 --> 17:15.850
Now, freeze!

17:21.630 --> 17:24.140
You guys only have one attack pattern!

17:24.780 --> 17:26.740
Been a long time since I've gotten rowdy!

17:26.740 --> 17:28.660
Prepare yourself, Great Witch!

17:54.440 --> 17:57.630
Well, I don't think there are 
any worthy opponents left!

17:57.630 --> 18:01.140
My master is the strongest there is!

18:01.510 --> 18:04.130
I guess we can wrap this up, then.

18:06.210 --> 18:07.450
Lady Azusa...

18:08.570 --> 18:10.650
Please face me next.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.610
Laika?

18:13.340 --> 18:15.400
Could you tell me why?

18:20.690 --> 18:25.360
I spend all my time by your side.

18:26.760 --> 18:32.400
And I have worked diligently 
as your disciple all this time

18:32.400 --> 18:34.470
in order to better myself.

18:34.950 --> 18:40.170
I would like you to see the 
results of my training now.

18:41.190 --> 18:44.850
I do not expect to defeat you, of course.

18:45.270 --> 18:47.430
I simply want to fight.

18:48.070 --> 18:53.690
And I want to accept a clean 
defeat so I can move forward!

18:54.280 --> 18:55.500
Laika...

18:56.710 --> 18:59.010
You're as serious as ever, I see.

19:00.030 --> 19:02.700
Okay, then. I won't go easy on you!

19:03.010 --> 19:03.900
Right!

19:06.980 --> 19:08.700
I'm ready when you are!

19:11.510 --> 19:14.200
Then let the match begin!

19:14.200 --> 19:16.600
Here I come, Lady Azusa!

19:20.670 --> 19:26.310
<i>Laika, this reminds me of the 
first time you came to my house.</i>

19:31.890 --> 19:35.020
<i>Because you challenged me to that duel,</i>

19:35.020 --> 19:38.490
<i>I gained a new family and 
the happiness I have now.</i>

19:39.800 --> 19:44.170
Happiness sure comes from 
unexpected places, huh?

19:55.960 --> 20:00.710
I'm glad your parents and everyone 
else accepted me, Flatorte.

20:00.710 --> 20:01.850
Yes!

20:01.850 --> 20:06.230
They told me to give my all in service 
to the strongest of witches!

20:06.550 --> 20:10.260
And what are you so down about, Laika?

20:10.260 --> 20:12.730
I-I'm not down at all!

20:13.270 --> 20:17.690
I'm just... starting to feel embarrassed

20:17.690 --> 20:21.240
for having asked such a silly favor of you.

20:21.650 --> 20:22.870
Oh?

20:26.060 --> 20:29.080
That was the decision you made 
for yourself in the moment.

20:29.080 --> 20:32.370
It's not silly, and it's nothing 
to be embarrassed about.

20:33.500 --> 20:36.690
Just keep your chin up and live proud.

20:38.900 --> 20:39.910
Okay.

20:40.500 --> 20:45.630
Hmph! Challenging her only to get your butt 
kicked is what's really embarrassing!

20:46.480 --> 20:48.830
I don't want to hear that from you!

20:48.830 --> 20:52.800
All you Blue Dragons ever do is challenge 
others to tests of strength!

20:52.800 --> 20:55.400
You should live more cultured lifestyles!

20:55.770 --> 20:57.440
Mind your own business!

20:57.440 --> 21:00.410
You can test your strength against 
me once your injuries have healed!

21:00.410 --> 21:03.880
Hah! Injuries of this level 
are the perfect handicap!

21:03.880 --> 21:05.750
I'll take you on anytime!

21:05.750 --> 21:07.910
Let's fight right now, then!

21:07.910 --> 21:09.810
Fine by me!

21:18.200 --> 21:21.370
How brave of you to challenge me to pinpong,

21:21.370 --> 21:24.180
a sport we Red Dragons have 
played since ancient times!

21:24.180 --> 21:26.920
I won't lose to you in any event!

21:28.940 --> 21:30.380
Here I come!

21:30.380 --> 21:31.620
Bring it on!

21:33.080 --> 21:34.900
That's nothing!

23:09.910 --> 23:12.410
<b>Days in the Highlands</b>

23:10.540 --> 23:12.400
Days in the Highlands!

23:12.990 --> 23:13.980
Hup!

23:14.670 --> 23:18.580
Ha ha! I am the strongest 
when I fight this way!

23:20.650 --> 23:22.680
I feel nauseous...

23:22.680 --> 23:24.700
Yeah, I'd imagine so.

23:25.420 --> 23:27.170
<b>Part 2</b>

23:25.730 --> 23:27.170
Part 2!

23:27.170 --> 23:28.760
Here it comes!

23:28.760 --> 23:32.920
The legendary serve handed 
down among the Red Dragons!

